sequenceDiagram
    participant Vendor
    participant Buyer
    participant API as GlowCart API
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Vendor, API: Authentication Required for Mutations
    
    Vendor->>API: POST /api/v1/stores/ (Create Store)
    API->>DB: Save Store
    DB-->>API: Store Object
    API-->>Vendor: 201 Created

    Vendor->>API: POST /api/v1/products/ (Add Product)
    API->>DB: Validate Store Ownership & Save Product
    DB-->>API: Product Object
    API-->>Vendor: 201 Created

    Buyer->>API: GET /api/v1/stores/?vendor_id={id}
    API->>DB: Query Stores by Vendor
    DB-->>API: Store List
    API-->>Buyer: 200 OK

    Buyer->>API: GET /api/v1/products/?store_id={id}
    API->>DB: Query Products by Store
    DB-->>API: Product List
    API-->>Buyer: 200 OK

    Buyer->>API: GET /api/v1/reviews/?product_id={id}
    API->>DB: Query Reviews
    DB-->>API: Review List
    API-->>Buyer: 200 OK
